        <div class="hero__contentRow ">
            <h1 class="hero__heading">Security hub</h1>
            
<p>Welcome to ANZ’s security hub. We’re here to look after you and your money - helping you to protect what matters.</p>
<p>Using security features like&nbsp;<a href="#protect-you">ANZ Falcon® and behavioural biometrics <img src="/content/dam/anzcomau/Icons/ico-jump-down.svg" alt=""></a>,&nbsp;which are personal to the way you bank, we study the difference between you and fraud, to help keep your banking safe.</p>
<p class="padding-top--20px margin-bottom--20px" style="text-align: left;"><a adhocenable="false" data-clicktrack="banner-ser-latest-alerts" aria-label="latest security alerts " href="/security/latest-scams-australia/" class="btn btn--blue link-no-underline">Latest security alerts&nbsp;</a><a adhocenable="false" data-clicktrack="banner-ser-contact-us" aria-label="Common scams" href="/security/#contact-us" class="btn btn--blue link-no-underline btn--transparent">Contact us</a></p>
<p><img src="/content/dam/anzcomau/images/bank-accounts/product-tile-horizontal-div.svg"></p>
<p style="float: left; margin-top: 5.0px; padding-right: 10.0px;"><img src="/content/dam/anzcomau/Icons/sparkle-oceanblue-icon.svg" width="28" height="28"></p>
<div style="width: 88.0%;"><b><span class="text--deep-current">Know Your Customer (KYC)</span></b><br>
We may occasionally contact you to update your personal or business details.&nbsp;<a data-clicktrack="knowyourcustomer-cta" href="/support/legal/know-your-customer/">Learn why</a>.<br>
<br>
</div>
            
                





            
