    <div class="text parbase">
<h2 class="beta ">Security articles and information</h2>
<p>Learn about frauds and scams and ways to help protect yourself, your family, or your business from cyber criminals.</p></div>



							</div>
							<div class="container__item container__main__element     none">
								




    
    
    <div class="text parbase">
<p><img src="/content/dam/anzcomau/images/security-hub/types-of-scams/types-of-scams-banner.jpg" alt="">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="paragraph-text--small"><span class="text--grayscale-45">TOPIC</span></p>
<h3 class="beta "><a id="name"></a><a href="/security/types-of-scams/" class="text--html-blue-link link-no-underline" data-clicktrack="ser-news-types">Types of fraud and scams<span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;</span></a></h3>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p class="paragraph-text--small"><span class="text--grayscale-45"><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;</span>28 articles</span></p>
<p class="paragraph-text--regular padding-top--10px margin-bottom---10px"><img width="100%" height="1" src="/content/dam/anzcomau/images/financial-wellbeing/icons/hrline-EEEEEE.gif" alt=""></p></div>


    
    
    <div class="text parbase">
<p class=" padding-top--40px"><img src="/content/dam/anzcomau/Icons/icon-shoppingbags.svg" alt="" height="40"></p>
<p class="paragraph-text--small"><span class="text--grayscale-45">ARTICLE</span></p>
<h3 class="gamma margin-bottom--10px ">Bank impersonation scams</h3>
<p>Don't get caught out by scammers pretending to be your bank. Understand the tricks scammers use, the signs that something might be off, and simple actions that could help you stay secure.</p>
<p><a href="/security/types-of-scams/bank-impersonation-scams/" class="text--html-blue-link link-no-underline" aria-label="Find out more about Bank impersonation scams" data-clicktrack="bank-impersonation-scams">Find out more<span class="icon"></span></a><span class="icon"></span></p>
<p class="paragraph-text--regular padding-top--10px margin-bottom---10px"><img width="100%" height="1" src="/content/dam/anzcomau/images/financial-wellbeing/icons/hrline-EEEEEE.gif" alt=""></p></div>


    
    
    <div class="text parbase">
<p class=" padding-top--40px"><img src="/content/dam/anzcomau/images/security-hub/how-to-protect-yourself/how-to-protect-yourself-splitbanner-1200x800.jpg" alt="">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="paragraph-text--small"><span class="text--grayscale-45">TOPIC</span></p>
<h2 class="beta "><a id="yourself"></a><a href="/security/protect-yourself/" class="text--html-blue-link link-no-underline" data-clicktrack="ser-news-protect-yourself">How to protect yourself<span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;</span></a></h2>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p class="paragraph-text--small"><span class="text--grayscale-45"><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;</span>14 articles</span></p>
<p class="paragraph-text--regular padding-top--20px margin-bottom---10px"><img width="100%" height="1" src="/content/dam/anzcomau/images/financial-wellbeing/icons/hrline-EEEEEE.gif" alt=""></p></div>



							</div>
							<div class="container__item container__main__element     none">
								




    
    
    <div class="text parbase">
<p><img src="/content/dam/anzcomau/Icons/icon-support-securityshield.svg" alt=""></p>
<p class="paragraph-text--small"><span class="text--grayscale-45">ARTICLE</span></p>
<h3 class="gamma margin-bottom--10px "><a id="action"></a>Cyber Security Action Month</h3>
<p>Cyber Security Action Month is your annual reminder to stay cyber secure. Here, we’ll explore simple actions you can take to better protect yourself online.</p>
<p><a href="/security/cyber-security-action-month/" class="text--html-blue-link link-no-underline" aria-label="Learn more about cyber security action month" data-clicktrack="ser-cyber-security-action-month">Find out more<span class="icon"></span></a></p>
<p class="paragraph-text--regular padding-top--10px margin-bottom---10px"><img width="100%" height="1" src="/content/dam/anzcomau/images/financial-wellbeing/icons/hrline-EEEEEE.gif" alt=""></p></div>


    
    
