<p class="paragraph-text--small"><span class="text--grayscale-45">ARTICLE</span></p>
<h3 class="gamma margin-bottom--10px "><a id="credit-card"></a>Credit card fraud</h3>
<p>Discover how to implement safeguards on your personal credit cards and help secure your financial information.</p>
<p><a href="/personal/credit-cards/credit-card-education/what-is-credit-card-fraud/" class="text--html-blue-link link-no-underline" aria-label="Learn more about credit card fraud" data-clicktrack="ser-news-cc">Find out more<span class="icon"></span></a></p></div>



